{title: Rang Barse Bheege Chunarwali}
{artist: Amitabh Bachhan Silsila}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Rang Barse Bhige [Dm] Chunarwali Rang Barse,        [D] Arre keene maari pichkaari tohri
[G] bheegi angiya,        Ho [A] rang rasiya, rang [Dm] rasiya ho
[A] Rang Barse Bhige [Dm] Chunarwali Rang Barse,        [D] Sone ki thaari main [G] jona pa [Dm] rosa
Are, [D] sone ki thaari main,        [D] Sone ki thaari main [G] jona pa [Dm] rosa
[A] Arre, khaye gori ka [Dm] yaar,        balam tar [A] se rang [Dm] barse
[A] Rang Barse Bhige [Dm] Chunarwali Rang Barse,        [D] Launga ilayachi ka
Arre launga ilayachi ka,        [D] Launga ilayachi ka.. haan
[D] Arre launga ilayachi ka [G] beeda [Dm] lagaya,        [D] Launga ilayachi ka [G] beeda [Dm] lagaya
[A] Arre chabe gori ka [Dm] yaar,        balam tar [A] se rang [Dm] barse
[A] Rang Barse Bhige [Dm] Chunarwali Rang Barse,        [D] bela chameli ka [G] sez bi [Dm] chhaya
Bela [D] chameli ka, [G] sez bi [Dm] chhaya,        Are, [D] bela chameli ka [G] sez bhi [Dm] chhaya
Haan, [D] bela chameli ka [G] sez bhi [Dm] chhaya?        [A] Arre, Soye gori ka [Dm] yaar
balam tar [A] se rang [Dm] barse
